sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Live Monitoring page
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as Demo PostgreSQL
  V->>V: Create deterministic hourly synthetic interval
  V->>A: POST /api/v1/energy/telemetry (authenticated)
  A->>A: Validate organization, meter, source, interval, value and timestamp
  A->>D: Transactional insert / idempotent retry
  D-->>A: Stored or duplicate result
  A-->>V: Ingestion status
  V->>A: Poll status and dashboard summaries
  Note over V,D: Browser cadence is 15 seconds; each event represents one hour. No physical meter is connected.
